<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2 错误处理 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/comprehensiveRust/day4-afternoon/error-handling/</link><description>Recent content in 2 错误处理 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 23:57:44 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/comprehensiveRust/day4-afternoon/error-handling/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>2.1 Panic</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/comprehensiveRust/day4-afternoon/error-handling/01-panics/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/comprehensiveRust/day4-afternoon/error-handling/01-panics/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
